{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123655","id":4584610378,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEUOaSg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123655/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123655/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/78421c7a736578f173f67f652dd3de7aa4151679","number":123655,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Semantic Rename Symbol feature to the GDScript text editor","user":{"login":"bkcetinkaya","id":46684966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Njg0OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46684966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya","html_url":"https://github.com/bkcetinkaya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add semantic Rename Symbol feature to the GDScript text editor\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n<img width=\"1202\" height=\"878\" alt=\"demo\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eada99ed-1172-4cc7-857c-fa6b1d67e278\" />\r\n\r\n- Implements a native, semantic \"Rename Symbol\" feature in the Godot Script Editor.\r\n- Allows developers to safely rename local and global/member variables across a script using `GDScriptParser` to build an Abstract Syntax Tree (AST), ensuring renames ignore comments and string literals.\r\n- Adds a user-facing `ConfirmationDialog` and `LineEdit` input popup triggered via the right-click context menu (or shortcut), integrated with standard undo/redo history (`Ctrl+Z`).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Implementation Details\r\n- **AST Resolution**: Walks function statements and expressions to isolate valid identifier nodes matching the symbol under the text caret, supporting both strict local variable bindings and name-based global/member fallbacks.\r\n- **Text Replacement**: Uses reverse-order replacement (`remove_text` / `insert_text` from bottom-to-top, right-to-left) wrapped in a complex undo operation to preserve coordinate integrity.\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure\r\n- AI assistance (Gemini) was utilized during the development process to help structure the AST visitor pattern logic, design the hybrid search/replacement boundaries, and troubleshoot editor UI layout bindings.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","descri